<string name="relays_off_note">[ಕನ್ನಡ] Turning this off stops new uploads. Sealed copies already on a relay are unreadable to it and expire within 48 hours.</string>
<string name="relays_empty">[ಕನ್ನಡ] No relays added. The Internet plane stays off until you add one — your messages still travel by Wi-Fi and Bluetooth.</string>
